                                "en": "He is seen by his colleagues as a real <w>guru</w> in the field of digital marketing."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "De bekende <w>goeroe</w> gaf een inspirerende lezing over de toekomst van kunstmatige intelligentie.",
